      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-10T18:31:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we do return false\nif event is true we abort, if not it\u0027s false, and line 227 returns it\n\nthe abort() should IMHO not happen because it\u0027s a violation of the poll() api",
