        "id": 1003247
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-10T18:31:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "no, it doesn\u0027t.  this is again afaik a violation of the poll() api.\n\nnote this is not looking at isEmpty() - that *could* race.\n\nthis is looking at the return value vs struct from poll.\n\nthis should not be able to ever trigger.\n\n(mostly added this for testing really, we could just delete the aborts)",
      "parentUuid": "e7bff903_47d48b56",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 222,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 223,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "78d3f23ac42c1ca79f50d449e4c057d95dcf407a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
