      "writtenOn": "2023-11-10T19:01:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC this can happen with map_poll if the poll_wait returns but then there is nothing to consume:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/common-android-mainline:common/kernel/bpf/ringbuf.c;l\u003d316-320\n\nI have seen the race when using multiple poll consumers on the same ring buffer.",
      "parentUuid": "c24fe1e4_b2203ebf",
